<refnamediv>
  <refname><function>SilikoFunctionCall</function></refname>
  <refpurpose>Function to invoke the implementation of an in-language
    function</refpurpose>
</refnamediv>

<refsynopsisdiv>
<programlisting language="C">#include &lt;SilikoCore/Function.h&gt;</programlisting>
<programlisting language="C">SilikoValue *SilikoFunctionCall(
    SilikoFunction *object,
    int argc,
    SilikoValue **argv);</programlisting>
</refsynopsisdiv>

<refsection>
<title>Description</title>

<para>The <function>SilikoFunctionCall</function> function calls the
<function>call</function> function in <varname>object</varname>’s
<type>SilikoFunctionVTable</type> forwarding <varname>argc</varname>
and <varname>argv</varname> to <function>call</function>.</para>
</refsection>

<refsection>
<title>Return Values</title>

<para><function>SilikoFunctionCall</function> forwards the return
  value yielded by <function>call</function>.</para>
</refsection>
